<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.9">
<l>kuṉṟeṭut tānirai kātta vāyā</l>
<l rend="indent">kōnirai mēyttava ṉēyem māṉē</l>
<l>aṉṟu mutaliṉ ṟaṟuti yāka</l>
<l rend="indent">ātiyañ cōtima ṟanta ṟiyēṉ</l>
<l>naṉṟuṅ koṭiya namaṉta markaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">nalintu valinteṉṉaip paṟṟum pōtu</l>
<l>aṉṟaṅku nīyeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Cowherd who protected the cow herd</l>
<l rend="indent">by lifting up a mountain!</l>
<l>You who grazed the cow herd! Our Lord!</l>
<l>From the first day to this last day,</l>
<l rend="indent">I have never forgotten [your]</l>
<l>ancient, extrordinary splendour.</l>
<l>When Yama’s extremely cruel attendants afflict,</l>
<l rend="indent"> compel, and seize me,</l>
<l>then and there you must protect me,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
